### 3. Two-Layer Separation (`Engine & Format` vs. `Base Model Weights`) & Mandatory Open Sharing of Compressed Weights (`All Models`)
1. **Separation from Third-Party Base Model Licenses:**  
   This License governs **exclusively the Software, Runtime Engine, Compute Kernels, and Tensor Container Format (`.packed_ternary`, `.row_scales`, `.jepa_u_q8`, `.jepa_v_q8`, and sidecar formats)**. Underlying third-party base model weights (such as those from DeepSeek-AI, NVIDIA, Meta, Google, Alibaba/Qwen, or Mistral) remain subject to their respective original model licenses. Obtaining a license from a base model creator does **not** grant any right to use this Software, Engine, or Container Format commercially without a paid commercial license from `terox27`.
2. **Mandatory Open Weight Sharing (`Share-Alike Across ALL Models of Any Size or Architecture`):**  
   Anyone who uses the Software or Blueprint under the free non-commercial tier (Section 1) to produce quantized, compressed, or SVD/JEPA-healed model weights — **for ANY model of ANY parameter size, byte footprint (`12 GB`, `106 GB`, `300 GB`, etc.), or architecture (Mixture-of-Experts, Dense, Vision, Multimodal, etc.)** — **MUST**:
   - **Share the resulting compressed model weights publicly and free of charge** (e.g., on Hugging Face) for the benefit of the community without paywalls, **AND**
   - Include prominent attribution linking back to **`https://github.com/terox27/Flash1017-Engine`** and **`https://terox27.github.io/`**.
3. **Models With Restrictive / Commercial Base Licenses or Private Weights:**  
   If an underlying base model's license prohibits public redistribution of derivative/compressed weights, or if a user or organization wishes to keep the compressed weights private/proprietary, the free non-commercial grant in Section 1 **does not apply**, and a **paid commercial license must be obtained from the Copyright Holder (`terox27`)** prior to compressing or running such weights.

